# ==============================================================================
# Dynamic Laptop Power Dispatch Rules
# Profile: ASUS ROG + NVIDIA RTX Laptop
# Dispatches power profile and GPU posture switcher on AC / USB-PD connect/disconnect.
#
# Anti-Storm Defenses:
# 1. Match strictly on ACTION=="change" and SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply".
# 2. Require ENV{POWER_SUPPLY_ONLINE}=="?*" so that battery charge rate, voltage,
#    current, and temperature polling telemetry are 100% ignored.
# 3. Restrict Mains power to barrel jack (ADP0, AC, ACAD) and USB to PD supplies.
# 4. Trigger /usr/local/bin/power-profile-switch.sh --async which implements
#    pre-flight state deduplication and singleton execution to suppress storms.
# ==============================================================================

# Barrel Jack AC Adapter online state transitions (connect / disconnect)
ACTION=="change", SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", ATTR{type}=="Mains", ENV{POWER_SUPPLY_ONLINE}=="?*", TEST=="/usr/local/bin/power-profile-switch.sh", RUN+="/usr/local/bin/power-profile-switch.sh --async"

# USB Type-C Power Delivery (UCSI / PD) online state transitions (connect / disconnect)
ACTION=="change", SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", ATTR{type}=="USB", ENV{POWER_SUPPLY_ONLINE}=="?*", TEST=="/usr/local/bin/power-profile-switch.sh", RUN+="/usr/local/bin/power-profile-switch.sh --async"

